# Pixel balloon example: an NPC changes what it says as progress changes.
# NPC IDs and quest IDs are stable strings owned by GameState, not scene names.

~ start
if GameState.npc_stage("coach_mira") == "new":
	Coach Mira: Welcome to Fit-Voido. I can help you start your first workout.
	set GameState.mark_met("coach_mira")
	- What should I do first?
		=> first_workout
	- I will come back later.
		Coach Mira: No problem. Find me when you are ready.
		=> END

if GameState.is_quest_active("first_workout"):
	Coach Mira: Your first workout is active. Complete the training-room challenge, then come back.
	- I am on it.
		=> END

if GameState.has_completed_quest("first_workout"):
	Coach Mira: You finished your first workout! Keep building that streak. [#mood=happy]
	- Thanks, Coach.
		=> END

Coach Mira: I am here whenever you need a reminder of your next goal.
=> END

~ first_workout
Coach Mira: Start with a gentle warm-up, then head to the training room.
set GameState.start_quest("first_workout")
Coach Mira: Come back after you finish the challenge.
=> END
